WEBVTT

00:04:29.756 --> 00:04:33.756
sparked a transformation
that influenced the whole country.

00:04:34.476 --> 00:04:37.116
We, of course, now hope,

00:04:37.156 --> 00:04:39.156
small as we may be,

00:04:39.196 --> 00:04:44.396
that we can spark a transformation
that will also affect other countries.

00:04:45.476 --> 00:04:47.676
We are a green frontrunner,

00:04:47.676 --> 00:04:52.476
but we need to do more
because at the same time,

00:04:52.516 --> 00:04:54.956
we rank number one in the EU,

00:04:54.996 --> 00:04:58.876
or at least as one of the biggest
oil producers, in the EU.

00:04:59.876 --> 00:05:01.396
This has to change.